  "id": "deletion",
  "term": "deletion",
  "definition": "In this source, deletion refers to the absence of genetic material from a gene. Specifically, spinal muscular atrophy is described as being caused when both copies of the SMN1 gene are deleted or otherwise lose normal function.",
